hich better reflects enterprise use cases through complex temporal reasoning tasks. In this evaluation, Zep achieves substantial results with accuracy improvements of up to 18.5% while simultaneously reducing response latency by 90% compared to baseline implementations. These results are particularly pronounced in enterprise-critical tasks such as cross-session information synthesis and long-term context maintenance, demonstrating Zep's effectiveness for deployment in real-world applications."}]", "excerpt_truncated": true, "source_sha256": "c181195a9af37a485d7bdd977934bc99ba9fc0ca698b628ef42132028af6185b", "verification_required": true, "topic_domain": "emergent_preferences", "evidence_role": "discovery", "host_tier": "discovery", "source_identity": null, "persistent_identifiers": ["doi:10.48550/arxiv.2605.21768", "openalex:W7162070983", "arxiv:2605.21768", "arxiv:2501.13956"], "source_candidates": ["https://doi.org/10.48550/arxiv.2605.21768", "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2605.21768", "https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.21768", "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2501.13956"], "source_candidate_identities": {}}

